				<wikidot:authorName>Zyn</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1404533</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p><sub>sad roach is sad</sub></p> <p>The caption is actually the first thing I came up with when writing the article. The picture used for the page came from my cell phone (I take a lot of random pictures, since I do a lot of walking) and when I was browsing through the images I looked at that roach picture and thought, &quot;Man. He looks so sad.&quot;</p> <p>And then the idea of sad roach stewed in my head for about two weeks, and then I wrote up a draft and Silber gave me lots of good suggestions and I just up and told him we should collaborate because oh man I was laughing so hard while pre-writing this.</p> <p>Anyway, glad you enjoyed!</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
